  "exhibitionHolyMosquesDesc": "Located in the Umm Al-Joud district.",
  "exhibitionHolyMosquesWhy": "Why visit: Contains historical artifacts like the Old Teak Wooden Staircase of the Kaaba (from 1825) and old doors of the Masjid Al-Haram.",
