  "prophetBiographyMuseumDesc": "Located just outside the Prophet's Mosque (south side).",
  "prophetBiographyMuseumWhy": "Why visit: Incredible modern displays and cinema screens detailing the life of the Prophet (Seerah) and a model of his house. Highly recommended.",
